WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.350
Let’s look at the elbows, and the tendons nearby.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:10.970
PsA can cause pain or tenderness in an elbow joint, or in the tendons nearby.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.190
Bending your arm, or lifting things, may feel harder.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:22.560
Pain near the elbow and a skin patch on the elbow are different kinds of change.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:26.680
Psoriasis patches often show up on the elbows.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:32.960
Tell your team whether the problem is in the skin, inside the joint, or around it.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.450
You do not have to know the medical name.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.750
Describe where it hurts, when it started, and what you find hard to do.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.850
An exam can help the team work out which tissues are involved.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:53.370
One tip to protect your joints: push a door open with your whole body, not just your fingers.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.440
Great job! Let’s review.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.930
You do not have to know the medical name.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:05.630
Pain near an elbow and a skin patch on the elbow are different types of change.
